      "note": "Root cause. After reading `c->l_qname` bytes of qname data into `b->data`, the vulnerable code never checks whether `b->data[c->l_qname - 1]` is `\\0` before the record is later exposed via `bam_get_qname(b)`. The fixing patch inserts exactly that missing post-read validation and repair immediately after this statement.",
